    {
      "id": "th-1017-1",
      "at": "2026-10-17T11:30:00Z",
      "kind": "take",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "Discipline isn't motivation.\n\nIt's kept promises.\n\nPick one thing you do every single day. Keep it for 30 days. That's where the mindset actually comes from.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "mindset-without-a-fight",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-17T11:35:59Z",
      "thread_id": "18119183992983728",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DemA8CKG008"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1017-2",
      "at": "2026-10-17T16:30:00Z",
      "kind": "question",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "Which one is you?\n\n1. You train when no fight is booked\n2. You keep going after getting dropped in sparring\n3. You've never needed a crowd to show up\n\nDrop the number.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "fighter-without-a-record",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-17T16:37:00Z",
      "thread_id": "18138306568650982",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DemjYjCkTKi"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1017-3",
      "at": "2026-10-17T21:30:00Z",
      "kind": "story",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "The sparring session you lose to someone better is worth more than ten you win.\n\nGetting picked apart shows you every hole at once.\n\nWatch it back the same night. Every mistake is right there.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "mindset-without-a-fight",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-17T21:35:57Z",
      "thread_id": "18354364960302026",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DenFmcnlBk6"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1018-1",
      "at": "2026-10-18T11:30:00Z",
      "kind": "take",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "You're mentally tougher than you think if you've lost and come back the next day.\n\nNot the next week. The next day.\n\nThat's the whole test.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "mentally-tougher",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-18T11:35:57Z",
      "thread_id": "18209333827371523",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/Deoluj3oPR9"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1018-2",
      "at": "2026-10-18T16:30:00Z",
      "kind": "question",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "What do you say in your head when you get hit clean?\n\nOne word beats a speech. Something like: reset.\n\nWhat's yours?",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "calm-without-experience",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-18T16:36:55Z",
      "thread_id": "18638510098018208",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DepILAhmkse"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1018-3",
      "at": "2026-10-18T21:30:00Z",
      "kind": "chain",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "How to stay calm in a fight when you don't have years of experience. A thread.",
      "chain": [
        "1. Exhale on every punch.\nYou can't panic and breathe at the same time.",
        "2. One job per round.\nJust the jab. Just the feet. A quiet head moves faster.",
        "3. Expect to get hit.\nIt's information, not failure. The shock goes away.",
        "4. Calm feet, calm head.\nWhen it gets chaotic, slow your feet first. The rest follows."
      ],
      "from": "calm-without-experience",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-18T21:36:49Z",
      "thread_id": "18023331710945637",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DepqZXNlcR9"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1019-1",
      "at": "2026-10-19T11:30:00Z",
      "kind": "take",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "A bad session ruining your whole day isn't weakness.\n\nIt means you care more than most people in the gym.\n\nJust don't let it ruin tomorrow's session too.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "made-for-combat-sports",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-19T11:36:02Z",
      "thread_id": "18146666725600741",
      "url": "https://www.threads.com/@matteofights/post/DerKiJ9mxbT"
    },
    {
      "id": "th-1019-2",
      "at": "2026-10-19T16:30:00Z",
      "kind": "question",
      "topic": "Fight Psychology",
      "text": "Rest days.\n\nDo they feel like recovery or like punishment?\n\nBe honest.",
      "chain": [],
      "from": "made-for-combat-sports",
      "status": "posted",
      "approved": true,
      "approved_note": "Matteo: approved via dashboard (2026-10-15T18:18:31Z)",
